{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"Rockman nods as his hands are full with a wooden beam. \"A bit better after some rest, but still worried.\" Its clear that he isnt used to working without Rush around.","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:34:01.588000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743568065274576947","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"understandable, I too am worried... Thats why I need your help, we all need your help actually\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:36:17.074000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743568633543786588","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"Which is why I am building these ballista...\" He sets the beam in place and pats it, confirming his resolve to build them. He looks out to the woodland. \"I can do nothing more than protect and build, it seems I fail at almost everything else.\" He looks down to the ring on his finger and smiles warmly \"...i only hope I can continue to be good enough for her.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:39:46.591000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743569512322039951","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"That's not true... You have done everything well. So what if you made a mistake along the way\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:40:45.680000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743569760159137883","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"do you know how many mistakes I made along the way to get where I am now?\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:41:04.268000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743569838122991657","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"His head turns to Percival. \"Sir Castor, i...\" He trails off a moment. \"I failed at being a knight, I failed at protecting my friend Sandi, I failed at finishing my work on time, I fail in fights, I fail at almost everything I've done.\" He stands a moment longer before walking a few feet to the pile of supplies, Hefting another beam to deliver to his build site.","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:44:55.691000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743570808781406308","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"You're not the only one who failed Gill, we all did... thats why we have to do better by him now, Thats why you can't give this up... You're not a failure you just need to find yourself...\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:48:14.758000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743571643728658482","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"Oh but I have\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:48:56.235000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743571817696067604","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"Ebuc would tell you the same thing if he were here\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:49:07.341000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743571864277745766","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"He sets the beam down suddenly","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:49:08.701000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743571869982261379","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"Before he can name what he found about himself, he stops...\"Ebuc... I've heard a few stories of my creator... Stories I cant fathom to understand in all their complexity...\" He picks the beam back up and sets it into place. \"Every time I fail at something, I get told a story of him... Like you all wish he was here instead of me.\" He pauses as he fastens the beam down. \"It seems that you all fall short on believing that I can do anything, you all just point out what he would do!\" He continues to work visibly getting stressed","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:54:59.050000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743573339452211261","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"No it's not like that... we tell you those stories because Ebuc was flawed, like you are, like i am, like we all are. We tell you those stories because we hope that you won't hold yourself to ridiculous standards that you currently are. Here I'll tell you a story about myself, before you met me I was a trainwreck, I was consumed with grief and wouldn't forgive myself for the things that happened, My fathers death, Rah's death, amara's death, my inability to stop the golden dawn... i took it out on myself by nearly drinking myself to death\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:59:00.204000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743574350925529320","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"Then I turned to excalibur and the knights... and they helped me, and even when I fucked up they still forgave me, just like they all forgive you\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:59:42.339000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743574527652528138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"Rockman head turns quickly to him.","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:59:51.906000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743574567779303447","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"And what of Ebuc? I was told he and 3 others entered a door and were never seen from? If you are so keen on telling stories then maybe you will be the one to tell me that particular one.\" His face calms as he pauses \"Leaf had mentioned the Golden Dawn twice. Once last night and once this morning... And now I hear that name a 3rd time. Who are they?\" He begins hammering down on a metal spike placed in the ballista","created_at":"2020-08-13T21:04:56.532000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743575845473353871","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"FIne if you want to know i'll tell you, The golden dawn is an order dedicated to evil and to soloman, they exist purely to strengthen the Hunger, they killed my father, Ebuc was angered at me and joined them out of spite but quickly realized that was a mistake... Him, Amara, Calmation, and Navar then went on a quest to end the Hunger prematurely... They weren't ready and now they're dead\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T21:07:25.497000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743576470277849174","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"So that's why we need complete unity now more than ever... Their decision splintered the rest of us caused bickering and fighting we still haven't truly recovered from'","created_at":"2020-08-13T21:11:49.604000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743577578023157841","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"Why only those 4? If Ebuc was as smart as you all say... Why not bring more to the fight?\" He pauses \"I built this wall, almost alone. To protect this town. I build these ballista, alone still... To defend the town.\" He strings the rooes along and cranks a wheel until it stops. \"I will accompany on quests or expeditions if asked. Otherwise I will be with my wife.\" He sets a sturdy staff in the ballista and pulls the lever to give it a test round.","created_at":"2020-08-13T21:17:39.910000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743579047312752660","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"Ebuc was smart but he was also dumb too... He was normal, you're the same way, And of course no one is forgetting the things you've done for us all I just want you to know that you haven't fucked up as much as you'd like to think\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T21:19:45.910000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743579575795056731","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
